OL,3,GNEWSAJersey could still face hosepipe
OL,4,Arestrictions
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is still a chance islanders could
OL,7,Fface a hosepipe restriction - despite
OL,8,Frecent rainfall taking Jersey out of a
OL,9,Fdrought.
OL,11,FA drought was declared last Tuesday
OL,12,Fafter 15 days without rain, but that
OL,13,Fdrought was broken on Tuesday, however,
OL,14,FJersey Water said it was still
OL,15,Fpreparing to use its desalination plant
OL,16,Fto turn sea water into drinking water.
OL,18,FJersey Water said reservoirs were 65%
OL,19,Ffull and that compared to its 10-year
OL,20,Faverage for August it was down from
OL,21,F77%.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
