OL,3,GNEWSAJersey could still face hosepipe
OL,4,Arestrictions
OL,5,
OL,6,FMark Bowden, head of water resilience,
OL,7,Fsaid it may need to introduce hosepipe
OL,8,Frestrictions "due to the long,
OL,9,Fcontinuous hot and dry weather and lack
OL,10,Fof rain over the spring and summer".
